WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.414
Multiply the numerator and denominator by the same nonzero number to make an

00:00:05.414 --> 00:00:06.216
equivalent fraction.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:14.540
Complete: 1/5 equals ?/10. The answer is 2. Multiply numerator and denominator by 2:

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:15.076
2/10.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:21.666
A recipe fraction during a sports day is 3/10. What is an equivalent fraction with

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:24.334
denominator 30? Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:31.863
A recipe fraction during a sports day is 3/10. What is an equivalent fraction with

00:00:31.863 --> 00:00:37.637
denominator 30? The answer is 9. Multiply numerator and denominator by 3: 9/30.
